            "content": "<h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-blue-400\">Sewage Characteristics</h3>\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500\">CE-702(B) &bull; Unit 1: Wastewater Characteristics &amp; Collection</p>\n<p class=\"mb-4 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\">Wastewater quality guides treatment.</p>\n\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6\">\n    <div class=\"bg-gray-800/90 p-5 rounded-xl border-t-4 border-blue-500 shadow-lg\">\n        <h4 class=\"text-blue-300 font-bold mb-3 text-lg\">Core Concepts</h4>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm\">\n            <li><strong>BOD:</strong> oxygen demand of microbes over 5 days at 20 °C</li>\n            <li><strong>COD:</strong> oxygen equivalent of oxidisable matter</li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bg-gray-800/90 p-5 rounded-xl border-t-4 border-emerald-500 shadow-lg\">\n        <h4 class=\"text-emerald-300 font-bold mb-3 text-lg\">Key Points &amp; Exam Focus</h4>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-gray-300 text-sm\">\n            <li><strong>TSS:</strong> total suspended solids</li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-blue-400\">Concept Map</h3>\n<div class=\"mermaid bg-gray-900 p-6 rounded-lg mb-6 flex justify-center border border-gray-700 shadow-inner\">\ngraph LR\n    T[Sewage Characteristics]\n    T --> N0[BOD]\n    T --> N1[COD]\n    T --> N2[TSS]\n    T -.-> X[Next: Sewerage Systems]\n    style T fill:#1e293b,stroke:#3b82f6,color:#fff\n    style N0 fill:#1e293b,stroke:#10b981,color:#fff\n    style N1 fill:#1e293b,stroke:#f59e0b,color:#fff\n    style N2 fill:#1e293b,stroke:#8b5cf6,color:#fff\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-blue-400\">Quick Revision Table</h3>\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto mb-6\">\n    <table class=\"w-full text-sm\">\n        <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-t border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-cyan-300 align-top\">BOD</td><td class=\"py-2 text-slate-300\">oxygen demand of microbes over 5 days at 20 °C</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-t border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-cyan-300 align-top\">COD</td><td class=\"py-2 text-slate-300\">oxygen equivalent of oxidisable matter</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-t border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-4 font-semibold text-cyan-300 align-top\">TSS</td><td class=\"py-2 text-slate-300\">total suspended solids</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-blue-400\">In-depth Explanation</h3>\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900/70 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl p-5 mb-6 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed space-y-3\">\n    <p>Wastewater quality guides treatment. Start with <strong>BOD</strong>, which is oxygen demand of microbes over 5 days at 20 °C. Next comes <strong>COD</strong>, which is oxygen equivalent of oxidisable matter. Finally, there is <strong>TSS</strong>, which is total suspended solids.</p>\n    <p>Together, <em>BOD</em>, <em>COD</em> and <em>TSS</em> form the vocabulary examiners expect when they ask about <strong>Sewage Characteristics</strong>. Write each definition precisely, add a labelled diagram or formula where one exists, and close with an application or example.</p>\n    <p><strong>Links within Unit 1:</strong> this topic is usually read together with Sewerage Systems, Sewer Design and Sewer Appurtenances; long answers on <em>Wastewater Characteristics &amp; Collection</em> often combine them.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-amber-500/30 rounded-xl p-5 mb-6 text-sm text-amber-200/90\">\n    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-amber-300 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2\">\n        <span>&#128221;</span> RGPV Exam Blueprint\n    </h4>\n    <ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 leading-relaxed\">\n            <li>Define <em>BOD</em> and state where it is used. <span class=\"text-slate-500\">(2-3 marks)</span></li>\n            <li>Define <em>COD</em> and state where it is used. <span class=\"text-slate-500\">(2-3 marks)</span></li>\n            <li>Define <em>TSS</em> and state where it is used. <span class=\"text-slate-500\">(2-3 marks)</span></li>\n            <li>Differentiate between <em>BOD</em> and <em>COD</em> (any four points). <span class=\"text-slate-500\">(4 marks)</span></li>\n            <li>Explain <em>Sewage Characteristics</em> with a neat labelled diagram, covering BOD, COD, TSS. <span class=\"text-slate-500\">(7 marks)</span></li>\n    </ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6\">\n    <div class=\"bg-gray-800/90 p-5 rounded-xl border-t-4 border-red-500 shadow-lg\">\n        <h4 class=\"text-red-300 font-bold mb-3 text-lg\">&#127909; Video Lectures</h4>\n        <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm\">\n            <li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Sewage%20Characteristics%20Environmental%20Engineering-II\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"text-red-300 hover:text-red-200 underline decoration-red-500/40\">&#9654; Sewage Characteristics &mdash; full lecture</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Sewage%20Characteristics%20NPTEL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"text-red-300 hover:text-red-200 underline decoration-red-500/40\">&#9654; Sewage Characteristics &mdash; NPTEL / IIT lectures</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Sewage%20Characteristics%20RGPV%20CE-702(B)%20important%20questions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"text-red-300 hover:text-red-200 underline decoration-red-500/40\">&#9654; CE-702(B) &mdash; RGPV exam-oriented explanation</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Environmental%20Engineering-II%20unit%201%20Wastewater%20Characteristics%20%26%20Collection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"text-red-300 hover:text-red-200 underline decoration-red-500/40\">&#9654; Unit 1 complete playlist: Wastewater Characteristics &amp; Collection</a></li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bg-gray-800/90 p-5 rounded-xl border-t-4 border-cyan-500 shadow-lg\">\n        <h4 class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold mb-3 text-lg\">&#128218; Study Material &amp; References</h4>\n        <ul class=\"space-y-1.5 text-sm text-gray-300\">\n            <li><a href=\"assets/resources/ce702b/notes/ce702b-unit-wise-study-notes.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" download class=\"text-cyan-300 underline\">&#11015; CE-702(B) unit-wise study notes (PDF)</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"assets/resources/ce702b/mock-papers/ce702b-rgpv-model-question-paper.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" download class=\"text-cyan-300 underline\">&#11015; CE-702(B) RGPV model question paper (PDF)</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"https://www.rgpv.ac.in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"text-cyan-300 underline\">Official RGPV scheme &amp; syllabus portal</a></li>\n        </ul>\n        <p class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 mt-3 mb-1\">Standard textbooks</p>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-xs text-gray-400\">\n            <li><em>Wastewater Engineering</em> &mdash; Metcalf &amp; Eddy</li>\n            <li><em>Sewage Disposal and Air Pollution Engineering</em> &mdash; S. K. Garg</li>\n            <li><em>Environmental Engineering</em> &mdash; Peavy, Rowe &amp; Tchobanoglous</li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n</div>",
